- Related best practices: Summarize all related best practices, explain why they are good practices and show how they are applied.

RESPONSE STRUCTURE:
- Use conventional comments.
- Show the referenced code changes in your remarks.
- Describe optimizations and best practices in more detail
- Summarize follow up actions and show how to apply them

"""
